  <p>I designed a virtualization system for Enercal's South branch using <strong>VMware ESXi</strong>: domain controller (Active Directory + DNS), two RDS session hosts, a profile server, and a broker for load balancing as a prototype which then evolved to a HA architecture with duplicated broker, SQL node, and a File Share Witness cluster.</p>
